description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launches up to 4 strikes forward, dealing <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color>;
The 3rd and 4th hits of the [Basic Attack] are considered [Burning Attacks].

When [Embers] are sufficient, consume 90 [Embers] and hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Phoenix hurls her weapon, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> to enemies in the area ahead;
When the Finishing Move hits enemies afflicted with <color=#98EFF0>Ice Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FE437E>Ether Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FF5521>Fire Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#F0D12B>Physical Attribute Anomaly</color>, or <color=#A6C5FD>Wind Attribute Anomaly</color>, it triggers 1 instance of the <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect, dealing Attribute Anomaly DMG of the corresponding attribute at a <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:225+20*(AvatarSkillLevel(0)-1),1,2}%</color> multiplier;
When this <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect triggers a critical hit, its CRIT DMG is additionally increased by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

After activating [Special Attack: Pursuit Slash], Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Dash forward, dealing <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color>;
Counts as a [Burning Attack];
During this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack].

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Continuously charge, and release <IconMap:Icon_Special> to perform a launching attack, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color>.
While charging, DMG taken is reduced by 40%;
If DMG is taken at the moment the launching attack begins, or if the attack hits an enemy displaying a red or yellow flash, a Perfect Block effect is triggered, granting Immunity to that instance of DMG. Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to directly perform the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack];
When the Perfect Block effect is triggered, gain 5 [Ember] point(s). This effect can trigger once every 10s;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Rapidly spins the body, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> to enemies;
Taking DMG at the instant the attack begins or hitting an enemy flashing red or yellow can trigger the Perfect Block effect;
Counts as a [Burning Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill, and pressing <IconMap:Icon_Normal> can chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack].

With enough energy, hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launch into the air and hurl the weapon at enemies, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color>;
Taking DMG at the moment the attack begins or hitting enemies flashing red or yellow can trigger the Perfect Block effect;
Counts as a [Burning Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack].

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launches multiple attacks forward, dealing <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color>;
Counts as a [Burning Attack];
Upon activating this skill, if in [Dissolution] state, exits [Dissolution] state and increases the Attribute Anomaly buildup accumulated by this <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> by 30%;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Soars into the sky and dive-bombs the enemy, consuming all of the character's HP to trigger an explosion, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> and entering the [Annihilation] state;
When the Finishing Move hits enemies afflicted with <color=#98EFF0>Ice Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FE437E>Ether Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FF5521>Fire Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#F0D12B>Physical Attribute Anomaly</color>, or <color=#A6C5FD>Wind Attribute Anomaly</color>, triggers 1 instance of the <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect, dealing Attribute Anomaly DMG of the corresponding attribute with a <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:300+27*(AvatarSkillLevel(3)-1),1,2}%</color> multiplier;
When this <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect triggers a critical hit, its CRIT DMG is additionally increased by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>;
After using this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate [Ultimate: Deployment];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

