1.desc:
When Phoenix enters the battlefield, she gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Energize]</color>. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180 second(s);
When Phoenix's attacks hit an enemy afflicted with <color=#FFFFFF>[Weakened]</color>, or when any squad member triggers Attribute Anomaly DMG against an enemy afflicted with <color=#FFFFFF>[Weakened]</color>, if the Attribute Anomaly DMG triggers a critical hit, its CRIT DMG is additionally increased by 20%;
When <color=#FFFFFF>[Burning Attack]</color> deals DMG, <color=#FFFFFF>[Embers]</color> acquisition efficiency is increased by 15%.

2.desc:
When Phoenix activates her <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, she enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Incineration]</color> state, lasting 10 seconds;
While in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Incineration]</color> state, landing or reapplying a <color=#FFFFFF>[Burning attack]</color> refreshes the duration;
While in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Incineration]</color> state, Phoenix's Anomaly Buildup Rate is increased by 15%, and the current <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> stacks are retained;
When activating <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Phase 2]</color>, recovers 8 Energy.

6.desc:
The number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters required for the Additional Ability is reduced by 1;
When the <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>'s Finishing Move hits an enemy afflicted with an Attribute Anomaly status, triggers 1 <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect, dealing a fixed 200% multiplier of the corresponding attribute's Attribute Anomaly DMG;
Attribute Anomaly DMG caused by Phoenix's <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect ignores 15% of the enemy's DEF.
